  "Question": "Cagney can frost a cupcake every \\(20\\) seconds and Lacey can frost a cupcake every \\(30\\) seconds. Working together, how many cupcakes can they frost in \\(5\\) minutes?",
  "Question Type": "text",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\(10\\)",
    "B": "\\(15\\)",
    "C": "\\(20\\)",
    "D": "\\(25\\)",
    "E": "\\(30\\)"
  },
  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "D",
  "Solution": "Both people work for \\(5\\cdot60=300\\) seconds. Dividing this time by the seconds needed per cupcake gives each person's output. Cagney frosts \\(300\\div20=15\\) cupcakes, and Lacey frosts \\(300\\div30=10\\) cupcakes. Their outputs add, so together they frost\n\\[\n15+10=25\n\\]\ncupcakes, choice \\(\\boxed{\\text{D}}\\).",
